      "content": "it's just that even \"professional help\" feels like more work. more talking, more trying, more fighting to stay afloat when i'm already drowning. everything feels so pointless. why do we even have to keep fighting this hard just to exist? it feels like the only way to actually get some peace is to just... not have to try anymore. to just stop.",
